{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"mechs\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他刚被眼前这一刻牵动，先知道自己有多在乎，却还不熟悉这份感受，也不知道怎样在其中安心待着。眼前的事情和它的意义都还没有真正成形，所以他悬着，甚至还说不出具体有什么可欢喜或可担心。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c1\", \"c2\", \"c6\", \"c9\", \"c10\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"这份快乐才刚刚触及他，还没成为能够持续享受的时刻。身体已经先激动起来，心里却不知道快乐能否继续，因此期待和不安同时出现。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"那个人已经深深吸引了他，但对方究竟是什么心意，还没有成为他能依靠的事实。正因为在乎对方，却不能确定对方的回应，期待里才带着悬而未决的感觉。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他只能确定自己真的被触动了，却还不知道这份快乐能不能与谁分享，也不知道究竟能持续多久。期待已经很真切，却没有任何可以依靠的确信。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他已经很在意接下来会发生什么，心先向前去了，却还没有真正尝到那份快乐。没有亲身经历可以让他确信接下来会怎样，所以期待和迟疑、不安同时存在。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c7\", \"c8\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"这份触动才刚刚发生，他还来不及确认它能否持续，就已经隐约感到，眼前这份吸引他的靠近不会停下来等他。这一刻正在流逝，他却还没来得及安稳地享受它。\",\n      \"premise\": \"无\",\n      \"members\": [\"c11\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0b4df2b9-3f54-4095-ab5e-9a689c29b2f2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T050419941348Z", "elapsed_seconds": 103.656, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T05:06:03.593176+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "80247626bd1d0018e6839ca209ad077e76eb6f159594f2a7644c33e428181ff8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T050419941348Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "73a6809a6684ac308531dde8ca956f9b96e1f3afa2a2f6090e205a6256232616"}}}
